  {"word":"〜ねえ","reading":"ねえ","meaning":"= ない (rough contraction)","word_type":"x","level":"Slang","category":"manga","note":"ない → ねえ. 知らねえ = 知らない, 関係ねえ = 関係ない, すげえ = すごい. Also ねえ! = hey!","examples":[{"jp":"そんなの知らねえよ。","en":"How should I know?"},{"jp":"まだ終わってねえ！","en":"It's not over yet!"}]},
