  {"word":"うるせえ","reading":"うるせえ","meaning":"shut up (rough form of うるさい)","word_type":"x","level":"Slang","category":"manga","note":"Classic tsundere or delinquent reply.","examples":[{"jp":"うるせえ！黙ってろ！","en":"Shut up! Keep quiet!"},{"jp":"うるせえな、分かってるよ。","en":"Shut up, I know."}]},
